# Testing

- Follow `docs/TESTING.md`. One test per acceptance criterion incl. error/empty/offline/permission-denied.
- Test users A and B in every suite; RLS tests in `tests/rls/`.
- Queries by role and name (Testing Library / Playwright `getByRole`) — doubles as an accessibility check.

## Never
- Snapshot-only tests
- weakening a test to pass
- real personal data in fixtures
